&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:1pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:8.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:1pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;当社から経営指導等を受けております。&lt;br/&gt;当社へ仕入業務を委託しております。&lt;br/&gt;役員の兼任：２名&lt;/p&gt;
